    "enUS": {
      "description": "Now, {name}, the hunt deepens.  Now you must defeat your prey, and then find your way to its lair.\n\nHunt the sunscale raptors to the south.  Slay them and remove the feathers they wear.  Place the feathers on the scytheclaw nests southwest of the Stagnant Oasis. Show their brethren you do not fear them!",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Visit Blue Raptor Nest",
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
